
Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1400
Set Height 760
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 70ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "NVIM_APPNAME=writing-dev nvim -u init.lua .scratch/demo.md"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Type "i"
Type "I recieve a letter every week."
Sleep 4s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 1s

Type "0w"
Sleep 2.5s
Tab
Sleep 1.5s

Type "w"
Sleep 1s
Type "w"
Sleep 4s
Tab
Sleep 2s

Type "$hvbb"
Sleep 4s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 1s

Type " lt"
Sleep 2s
Type " lt"
Sleep 2s
